  "fullDescription": "Add cozy, storybook charm to your holiday projects with this Christmas Digital Paper Bundle — a collection of 12 delightful digital papers featuring Christmas trees with snowflakes, star prints, smiling gingerbread men with candy canes and stockings, checkered snowflake grids, sage green stripes, cheerful snowmen, and adorable reindeer, all in a warm cream, forest green, and berry pink holiday palette.\n\nEach pattern is crafted at 3600×3600 px, 300 DPI and comes in two flexible file formats — SVG and JPG — giving you fully editable vector artwork alongside high-resolution raster files, perfect for both print and digital Christmas-themed projects.\n\nPerfect for:\n\nChristmas gift wrap and packaging\nDigital scrapbooking & junk journals\nHoliday stationery, cards & tags\nParty & event decor (banners, backdrops, invitations)\nHome decor mockups (stockings, ornaments, wraps)\nWebsite & social media seasonal backgrounds\nPlanner covers, stickers & printables\n\nWhat’s Included:\n✔ 12 unique Christmas-themed seamless patterns\n✔ SVG (fully editable, layered vector files)\n✔ JPG (print-ready high resolution)\n✔ 3600 x 3600 px / 300 DPI\n✔ Seamless & tileable design — no visible repeat lines\n✔ Instant digital download\n\nThese patterns are 100% original designs, making them safe and versatile for commercial and personal creative use.",
